 "rounds": [
  {
   "id": "deployment",
   "no": "",
   "title": "Deployment",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": [
      "{p:The Carrion Psalm} enter the bullet den through the casting hall and the quench house. The Furnace is still roaring at the heart of the works, and the heat comes off it in waves. Before the night is out, the Cawdor mean to mark their claim on the territory.",
      "But {t:The Midnight Theatre} are hot on their tail, slipping in through the shell works and the magazine. Deuteronomy's orders are simple. The Theatre do not need to win this fight. They only need to leave the Cawdor bleeding in the dark, too many of them down or tied up to fight back."
     ]
    },
